
!*.tfvars.example
!.env.example
!/CLAUDE.md
# Keep root CLAUDE.md; ignore claude-mem's per-folder copies everywhere.
# The root CLAUDE.md is the only one committed; every nested CLAUDE.md is
# an auto-generated claude-mem artifact.
# ── Claude Code local override (per-developer, never commit) ──
# ── Model weights / heavy artifacts (download on Colab, don't commit) ──
# ── Node / Workbench ─────────────────────────────────────────
# ── OS / editor / tooling ────────────────────────────────────
# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Runtime / outputs ────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Secrets (NEVER commit) ───────────────────────────────────
# ── Terraform ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── claude-mem MCP context artifacts (auto-generated, never commit) ──
